# Local env overrides. Note that `.env` itself IS tracked in this repo: it holds
# only the Supabase URL, project ref and the anon key, all of which are compiled
# into the browser bundle anyway, and the ServerHoster deploy may be building
# straight from the checkout. Untracking it needs deploy-side coordination
# first — see the note in README.md.
#
# Nothing secret goes in .env. Edge-function secrets belong on the Supabase
# project (`supabase secrets set …`), never in a file the browser bundle reads.
.env.local
.env.*.local
